  {
   "value": "bright_foreground_holo_dark = @color/background_holo_light = #fff3f3f3；dim_foreground_holo_dark = #bebebe；hint_foreground_holo_dark = #808080",
   "meaning": "Holo 暗色主色 #F3F3F3、次色 #BEBEBE、提示色 #808080（selector 默认项解析到这些色）",
